 base: str):\n    \"\"\"Build and print a summary table for a single directory.\n\n    Collects the parsed values for every round file in ``ROOT / d``, groups them\n    by arm, computes the mean over rounds for each test, and prints a table that\n    also shows the percentage delta of each arm's mean relative to the baseline\n   "}